    "description": {
      "value": "This ring is utilitarian in design\u2014indicating its martial use. Its band is decorated only with a simple, sharp-edged sculpture on the band's center. While wearing this ring, you add your level to your attack rolls with all weapons with which you are untrained. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the attack roll. If you are an expert in any weapon, you instead gain a +4 circumstance bonus to the attack roll."
